# Captured production payloads + rendered output — regenerate, never commit.
#
# Globbed rather than enumerated. The previous version listed each directory by
# name and had been amended five times as new probes were added; the sixth
# (shots_login/) slipped through and showed up as untracked, which matters here
# because HOMER runs `git add -A` on the VM and would have committed a few
# hundred screenshots. Anything matching these shapes is derived output.
fixtures*/
shots*/
census_*.json
fontcensus.json
findings.json
structural.json
contrast.json

# One-off probes written during a single investigation, not part of the harness.
audit_pre.mjs
check-ratios.mjs
